              <item><widget class="QLabel"><property name="text"><string>&lt;b style="color:#AFC4D8;"&gt;ABOUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Remote Sensing Studio is a professional QGIS plugin for remote sensing analysis and Earth observation workflows.&lt;br/&gt;It provides local raster and Google Earth Engine workflows, vegetation analysis, visualization, quality assessment, and scientific reporting.</string></property></widget></item>
              
              <item><widget class="QLabel"><property name="text"><string>&lt;b style="color:#AFC4D8;"&gt;WEB DEMO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Explore the interactive Remote Sensing Studio Web Demo.</string></property></widget></item>
              
